 \"${srcdir}/build\"` | **Build directory** \u2014 where all compiled artifacts go |\n| `-G Ninja` | Use the **Ninja** build system (faster than Make for large projects) |\n\n```bash\n-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release\n```\nCompiles with **optimizations enabled** (`-O3`, no debug"}